1. Plugin Independence / 插件独立性
   Plugins, extensions, adapters, and shims that merely depend on, link against,
   or interact with TurboDL through its public APIs and extension points are
   independent works. They may be licensed under any terms their authors choose
   and are NOT considered derivative works of TurboDL solely by such use.
   仅通过 TurboDL 的公开 API 与扩展点依赖、链接或交互的插件、扩展、适配器与垫片，
   属于独立作品，可由其作者自行选择任意许可，不因此类使用而被视为 TurboDL 的衍生作品。

2. Third-Party Ecosystem Interop / 第三方生态互操作
   Adapter/shim plugins that translate between TurboDL extension points and
   third-party download ecosystems are permitted. Such interoperability does not
   grant any rights to the third-party software; users must independently comply
   with the licenses of any third-party components they choose to interoperate with.
   允许编写在 TurboDL 扩展点与第三方下载生态之间做接口翻译的适配器/垫片插件。
   该互操作不授予对第三方软件的任何权利；用户须自行遵守其所对接第三方组件的许可。

3. Attribution for Design Inspiration / 设计致谢
   TurboDL's engine design was informed by the ideas of several open-source
   download managers WITHOUT copying their source code. No endorsement by those
   projects is implied.
   TurboDL 的引擎设计参考了多个开源下载器的思想，但未复制其源码；不暗示这些项目的任何背书。

4. No Trademark Rights / 商标
   These licenses do not grant rights to use the names, logos, or trademarks of
   TurboDL, its authors, or any referenced third-party project.
   本许可不授予使用 TurboDL、其作者或任何被引用第三方项目的名称、标识或商标的权利。
